{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0552A0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"来这里之前，你在<R=高级研究计划局,ARPA>吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=高级研究计划局,ARPA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。当时能把AI研究当作工作来做的地方，大概也只有那里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那之前呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我原本在<R=美国国家航空航天局,NASA>。我就是在那里认识她的。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=美国国家航空航天局,NASA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"然后把The Boss送上宇宙……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……是啊。正是那件事让我离开了航空航天工程。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"对活生生的人类来说，宇宙实在太危险了。所以我觉得必须尽快开发AI。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不过后来火箭的安全性也提高了，人类甚至登上了月球……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不管怎样，那都是冷战催生的虚花。说到底，只要给火箭装上核弹头，它就成了核导弹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"所以，在航天开发上取得主导权，同时也是一种军事示威。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"美苏两国都承受不住那种庞大的预算负担。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"没错。还有古巴危机的冲击和越南问题。然后是<R=紧张缓和,DÉTENTE>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=紧张缓和,DÉTENTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"美国通过登月大幅甩开苏联后，在1972年结束了阿波罗计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"同一时期，<R=高级研究计划局,ARPA>更名为<R=国防高级研究计划局,DARPA>，组织规模也被缩小。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=高级研究计划局,ARPA>\", \"<R=国防高级研究计划局,DARPA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":121,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"AI研究也变得难以继续。对我来说，Coldman的邀请正是及时雨，也能让他们替我收集她的数据。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"结果就变成了这次事件。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"但我们也从她那里学到了和平的可贵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""}]}